{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub039_policef_01",
      "hash": "426534fabe078478",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我最近捕获了\\n一只喜欢捣乱的杰尼龟！\\c\\n要是能碰到个有水平的训练家，\\n我想把杰尼龟托付出去……"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub039_policef_06",
      "hash": "42653bfabe07905d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗯～你至今为止\\n捕捉到的宝可梦的数量有——\\r\\n[VAR NUM9(0000,0000)]只呀！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub039_policef_02",
      "hash": "426537fabe078991",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "看来你……\\n是个有水平的训练家啊！\\c\\n我能把这只爱给人添麻烦的\\n杰尼龟托付给你吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub039_policef_03",
      "hash": "426536fabe0787de",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那就交给你咯！\\n你要好好照顾它噢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub039_policef_07",
      "hash": "42653afabe078eaa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "等你捉到的宝可梦差不多有[VAR NUM3(0000)]只时，\\n我再来拜托你吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub039_policef_04",
      "hash": "426539fabe078cf7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "这该怎么办……\\n这可真让人头疼。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub039_policef_05",
      "hash": "426538fabe078b44",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "杰尼龟过得好吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub039_poke_01",
      "hash": "fe599006e0672827",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "杰尼龟：杰尼杰尼～"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_sub_event_039_max",
